  "not_checked": [
    "Patents, code, startups, funding and policy are not in this scan, so it can't say how far along the pipeline any area is. Patents need a free key from a patent office or Lens.org.",
    "The search terms were not validated by reading a sample of matching works, so some matches are off-topic and some relevant work uses other words.",
    "The usual range rests on 10 years of growth, so it is imprecise; a z near 2 or 3 is a lead, not proof.",
    "OpenAlex changed its coverage in 2025. Shares correct for its size, not for which fields the new sources favour.",
    "The second pass, with the article-only base and the synthetic biology checks, was not sent back to the challenger.",
    "Institution and country shares count works of every type, not only articles.",
    "No hold-out data were set aside, and 5 areas × 3 years is 15 comparisons. Synthetic biology's 2025 value (4.7 SD) survives that correction; values near 2 would not.",
    "This is a quick run of the method, not a forecast. Nothing here says which area matters for you.",
    "This page was rebuilt by poiesis-studio from the recorded run's files. Its verdicts come from challenge records written on 2026-11-22 over the published page's wording, with the challenger's recorded verdicts (fixtures/challenge-verdicts.json)."
